Package: focus-reminder
Version: 2.0.39
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: python3, gir1.2-gtk-3.0, gir1.2-ayatanaappindicator3-0.1
Recommends: fonts-inter, gvfs-backends
Maintainer: Focus Reminder <local>
Description: Whole-device focus reminder with goals, waste tracking and suspend lockout
 Fullscreen 10-minute focus reminders, goal manager with dates, typing
 practice, per-day waste ledger, emergency suspend (minutes/hours/days)
 with reboot-proof lockout, and a persistent system tray.
 Runs automatically for every user via systemd user services.
